        },
        {
          "text": "Kwondũ wa ũu Yeova atũma mũimũ ĩũlũ wa Isilaeli kuma kĩoko o kũvika ĩvinda yĩla yatw’ĩtwe; na kwakwie ma andũ kuma Ndani kũvika Mbeeli‐sieva andũ ngili mĩongo mũonza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
