              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na yĩla mũlaĩka watambũũkisye kw’oko kwake kwelekela Yelusaleme amyanange, Yeova eealyũla ũndũ wa ũthũku ũsu, na eea mũlaĩka ũla wanangaa andũ, Nũũ; yu siĩĩa kw’oko kwaku. Na mũlaĩka wa Yeova aĩ vakuvĩ na kĩvũĩo kya Alauna Mũyevusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
