          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Ndaviti ambata kwĩanana na ndeto sya Ngati, o tondũ Yeova weaie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Alauna asisya, na oona mũsumbĩ na athũkũmi make mokĩte mamwelekele: na Alauna aumaala, na amwĩkunamĩsya mũsumbĩ ũthyũ wake welekele nthĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Alauna amũkũlya, Nũndũ wa kĩ mwĩaĩi wakwa mũsumbĩ woka kwa mũthũkũmi wake? Na Ndaviti asya, Nĩkũthooee kĩvũĩo, nĩmwakĩe Yeova kĩthembeo, nĩ kana ũthĩn’yo ũũ ũsiĩĩwe wumwe andũnĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
